## 入口清单

### HTTP 入口分组（按 controllers/）

| 分组 | 路径前缀 | 典型用途 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Console | `/console/api/*`（`api/controllers/console/`） | 控制台 API（应用、数据集、租户、计费、模型、工作流、触发器等） |
| Service API | `/api/*`（`api/controllers/service_api/`） | 对外开放 API（终端用户使用） |
| WebApp | `/web/*`（`api/controllers/web/`） | WebApp（分享应用 / 嵌入聊天）使用 |
| Files | `/files/*`（`api/controllers/files/`） | 文件上传/预览 |
| Inner API | `/inner/api/*`（`api/controllers/inner_api/`） | 同集群内部 API |
| MCP | `/mcp/*`（`api/controllers/mcp/`） | MCP 协议 |
| Trigger | `/trigger/*`（`api/controllers/trigger/`） | Webhook 触发器 |

### 异步 / 实时 / 调度入口

| 入口 | 来源 | 说明 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Celery Worker | `api/celery_entrypoint.py` + `api/tasks/*` | 通过 `EDITION` 选择默认队列 |
| Celery Beat | `api/celery_entrypoint.py` + `api/schedule/*` | 计划任务发布器 |
| Socket.IO | `api/extensions/ext_socketio.py` + `api/controllers/console/socketio/workflow.py` | 工作流协作 |
| Plugin Daemon | `api/core/plugin/impl/*` 通过 HTTP 客户端调用 dify-plugin-daemon | 插件运行时 |

## 调用链分析

### Chat 应用对话（同步 SSE，简化版）

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Browser
    participant Console as controllers/console/app/completion.py
    participant AppGen as services/app_generate_service.py
    participant ChatApp as core/app/apps/chat/app_runner.py
    participant Mod as core/moderation
    participant Mem as core/memory
    participant Prompt as core/prompt
    participant Model as core/model_manager
    participant Tools as core/tools
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Trace as ops 链路追踪

    Browser->>Console: POST /chat-messages (SSE)
    Console->>AppGen: generate(app, user, query, ...)
    AppGen->>ChatApp: run(app_config, conversation, query)
    ChatApp->>Mod: pre_check(query)
    ChatApp->>Mem: load_history(conversation)
    ChatApp->>Prompt: build_messages(query, history, system)
    ChatApp->>Model: stream_chat(messages)
    loop streaming
        Model-->>ChatApp: token chunks
        ChatApp-->>Console: yield SSE event
        Console-->>Browser: data: {...}
    end
    ChatApp->>DB: persist message + token usage
    ChatApp->>Trace: emit trace
```

### Workflow 执行（高度简化）

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Trigger as 控制台 / WebApp / Webhook
    participant WorkflowSvc as services/workflow_service
    participant Engine as core/workflow
    participant Node as 节点 (LLM/Tool/Knowledge/...)
    participant Queue as Celery worker (workflow*)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Plugin as Plugin Daemon
    participant Sandbox

    Trigger->>WorkflowSvc: run(workflow_id, inputs)
    WorkflowSvc->>Engine: build run from graph + variables
    Engine->>DB: persist WorkflowRun
    loop 每个节点
        Engine->>Node: execute(state)
        alt 节点需要外部能力
            Node->>Plugin: invoke plugin
            Node->>Sandbox: run code
        end
        Node-->>Engine: outputs / events
        Engine->>DB: persist NodeExecution
    end
    alt 异步分发
        Engine->>Queue: dispatch（async_workflow_tasks）
    end
    Engine-->>WorkflowSvc: stream events
    WorkflowSvc-->>Trigger: SSE / Socket.IO
```

### RAG 索引（异步）

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Console as controllers/console/datasets/datasets_document
    participant DatasetSvc as services/dataset_service
    participant Proxy as services/document_indexing_proxy
    participant Worker as Celery (dataset / pipeline)
    participant Runner as core/indexing_runner
    participant Extract as core/rag/extractor
    participant Split as core/rag/splitter
    participant Embed as core/rag/embedding
    participant VDB as 向量数据库

    Console->>DatasetSvc: 上传 / 索引文档
    DatasetSvc->>Proxy: enqueue indexing
    Proxy->>Worker: send to "dataset" / "pipeline" queue
    Worker->>Runner: run(document)
    Runner->>Extract: 抽取
    Runner->>Split: 切分
    Runner->>Embed: 向量化
    Embed->>VDB: upsert vectors
    Runner-->>Worker: status / metrics
```

## 数据流转说明

| 流程 | 输入 | 主要中间数据 | 输出 / 落地 |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Chat 应用 | 用户 query + 历史 + 应用配置 | prompt messages、模型流式 chunk | DB 中 `Conversation` / `Message`、token 使用、trace |
| Workflow | 起点 inputs + 触发上下文 | 节点 outputs、变量池、events | `WorkflowRun` / `NodeExecution` / `event_snapshot` / 输出文件 |
| RAG 索引 | 原始文档 / 网页 / 数据源 | 抽取文本、切片、向量 | `Dataset/Document/Segment` 行 + 向量库条目 + 对象存储原文 |
| RAG 检索 | 查询 query + dataset 配置 | 召回候选、重排得分 | 检索结果（节点输入或命中测试响应） |
| Agent | 任务描述 + 工具列表 | tool calls、observations | 最终回答 + 工具调用日志 + trace |

## 状态流转

| 业务对象 | 状态机来源 | 关键状态 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `WorkflowRun` | `models/workflow.py` + `core/workflow/*` | running / paused / succeeded / failed / stopped |
| `NodeExecution` | 同上 | pending / running / succeeded / failed / retrying |
| `Document` 索引 | `models/dataset.py` + `core/indexing_runner.py` | waiting / parsing / cleaning / splitting / indexing / completed / paused / error |
| `Conversation` | `models/model.py` | normal / archived（视实现） |
| `Plugin` 安装 | `services/plugin/*` | pending / installing / installed / failed |
| `TriggerSubscription` | `services/trigger/trigger_subscription_*` | builder pending / building / verified / failed |
| `Account` / `Tenant` | `models/account.py` + `services/account_service.py` | pending / active / banned 等 |

## 异常 / 降级处理

| 类别 | 模块 | 说明 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 模型调用异常 | `core/errors/`、`services/errors/llm.py` | 重试、限流、降级模型 |
| 内容审核拒绝 | `core/moderation/` + `services/errors/` | 拦截响应 |
| 限流 / 配额 | `services/quota_service.py`、`services/billing_service.py` | 软/硬限制 |
| Sandbox 异常 | `core/helper/code_executor/code_executor.py` | 超时、内存、安全策略 |
| 插件 daemon 不可用 | `core/plugin/impl/exc.py`、`core/plugin/endpoint/exc.py` | 失败回填、断路 |
| Webhook 异常 | `services/trigger/trigger_request_service.py` | 重试、签名校验失败 |
| 工作流节点失败 | `core/workflow/nodes/agent/exceptions.py`、`core/workflow/nodes/*` | 节点级错误捕获 + 失败分支 |
| 异步任务失败 | Celery 重试 + `tasks/*_proxy.py` | 重试策略与隔离队列 |
| HTTP 错误 | `controllers/*/error.py` + `controllers/common/errors.py` | 域异常 → HTTP 响应 |

## 性能关键点

| 关键点 | 模块 | 说明 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| LLM 流式吞吐 | `core/app/task_pipeline/*`、`core/llm_generator/*` | 必须保持 SSE 低延迟 |
| 工作流大图执行 | `core/workflow/*`、`core/app/apps/advanced_chat/*` | 节点并行、变量池效率 |
| RAG 大文档索引 | `core/indexing_runner.py`、`core/rag/index_processor/*` | 批处理、限流 |
| 向量检索 | `core/rag/retrieval/dataset_retrieval.py` + 各 vdb provider | 召回延迟、重排成本 |
| 数据库高并发 | `extensions/ext_database.py`、`core/repositories/*` | 连接池、`tenant_id` 索引 |
| Redis | `extensions/ext_redis.py`、协作模块 | 在线用户、队列、限流 |
| 插件 daemon 调用 | `core/plugin/impl/*` | 网络延迟、超时控制 |
| 出网请求 | `core/helper/ssrf_proxy.py` + `core/helper/http_client_pooling.py` | SSRF 防护、连接复用 |

